This file is a patch to the Lean library Zeta23 of https://github.com/anthropics/formal-math
(directory zeta23), commit fbdc36bbf17d20af3fd0447c6d1a8a02773c9844.

LICENCE. The library is Copyright (c) 2026 Anthropic, PBC and is released under the Apache
