it is distributed under the same licence, the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of the licence
is in the file LICENSE next to this file, and the library's NOTICE file is reproduced in the
file NOTICE.

CHANGES. The fourteen files named below were changed on 2 October 2026 by Kristian Muri Knausgård
<kristianmk@ieee.org>, with AI assistance (Claude, Anthropic). Two lower bounds in the hypotheses
of the general window machinery are relaxed, 1/2 <= b to 1/8 <= b and 1/2 <= a to 1/4 <= a, and
the proofs that used them are adjusted. The five declarations whose content changes are
propositions that collect hypotheses (LocalHypsCore, LocalHypsCoreW, AdmFamily, WindowZeroSide,
FactsXi); each of them now asks for less. No definition of a mathematical object (zeros, counts,
windows, constants) is changed, no axiom and no unproved statement is added, and the library's
Challenge.lean, ChallengeDeps.lean and Solution.lean are not touched. Files to which this patch
has been applied are modified files in the sense of the licence and are no longer the files
published by Anthropic.

Apply in the directory zeta23 of the library:  patch -p1 < upstream_relax.patch

